  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Once entered, the temperature falls drastically into an icy world. The ground is all white. A mountain stands tall, made entirely of frost crystals. At the peak of that frost crystal mountain is a palace made of ice and snow.",
      "chapters": [
        1969
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch is a snowman Gu Immortal who opens Ice Crystal grotto-heaven for the black-heaven meeting on the qi-tide crisis. Lady Cold Ash expects the gathering to be dominated by variant human Gu Immortals. Inside the ice-and-snow palace, the snowman sits at the main seat and urges the grotto-heaven forces to take action while five-region Gu Immortals recuperate.",
      "chapters": [
        1969
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "variant-human-summit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ice_crystal_immortal_monarch",
        "race_snowmen",
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lady Cold Ash later flies back toward the entrance of Ice Crystal grotto-heaven after the meeting.",
      "chapters": [
        1970
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "variant-human-summit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After that summit, Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch stays active in asking grotto-heavens to work together, and Granny Skeleton expects him to gather variant human forces in other regions’ black heaven as well.",
      "chapters": [
        1975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "variant-human-summit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_granny_skeleton"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The air in Ice Crystal grotto-heaven is always cold. Ice Crystal grotto-heaven holds the blizzard icy plain, the largest gathering spot of the snowman race there and the site of Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch’s coming-of-age ceremony. After he inherits the Immortal Monarch title and owns the grotto-heaven, he develops that plain so snowman numbers and resources rise. When Demon Judgment Board invades, rank six and seven snowman Gu Immortals answer with a formation blizzard, and a blood-red strike destroys the plain, killing nearly ten million ordinary snowmen. Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch then treats the fight as a duty to protect his race.",
      "chapters": [
        1994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blizzard-icy-plain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_demon_judgment_board"
      ]
    }
  ],
